  m_Name: 3 Two bulbs in series
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ARCircuitsLab.Tasks.TaskData
  title: Two bulbs in series
  goal: Light two bulbs one after the other in a single loop.
  hint: Press and hold the resistor to remove it. Put a second bulb in its place,
    so there is only one path.
  goalType: 2
  points: 100
  successTitle: Both bulbs are on!
  explanation: In series the same current ({0:0.00} A) passes through both bulbs,
    so each one is dimmer.
